  "synopsis": {
    "zh": "陸氏為王璵妻，持法華、禮懺、念佛三十年，篤意淨土。面西結印與天鼓為原書瑞相記載，未明言已生極樂。",
    "en": "Lady Lu, wife of Wang Yu, sustained recitation, repentance and Buddha-recitation for thirty years. Her Pure Land intention is explicit, but the signs at death do not explicitly establish completed rebirth in Sukhāvatī."
  },
